      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Automation remembers a knob moving. It holds a gesture already, twisting the kaleidoscope, and a four-second gear's Trigger presses its Restart every loop. To record your own, press Record, move Input Value for the four seconds of its Duration, and it plays back from the next loop. Min and Max scale it."
        }
      },
